function copySelected(){if(!app.selected||app.selected.type==="edge")return;const {type,id}=app.selected;if(type==="card"){let cards=flow().cards.filter(c=>app.multiSelected.has(c.id));if(!cards.length&&card(id))cards=[card(id)];const ids=new Set(cards.map(c=>c.id));app.clipboard={type:"cards",cards:structuredClone(cards),groups:[],edges:structuredClone(flow().edges.filter(e=>ids.has(e.from)&&ids.has(e.to)))};toast(`${cards.length}件のカードをコピーしました`)}else{const g=group(id),cards=flow().cards.filter(c=>c.groupId===id),ids=new Set(cards.map(c=>c.id));app.clipboard={type,groups:[structuredClone(g)],cards:structuredClone(cards),edges:structuredClone(flow().edges.filter(e=>ids.has(e.from)&&ids.has(e.to)))};toast("領域と子カードをコピーしました")}}
function pasteSelected(){const clip=structuredClone(app.clipboard);if(!clip)return;history();const idMap=new Map(),groupMap=new Map();clip.groups.forEach(g=>{const old=g.id;g.id=uid("group");g.x=grid25(g.x+25);g.y=grid25(g.y+25);g.w=grid25(g.w);g.h=grid25(g.h);g.locked=false;groupMap.set(old,g.id);flow().groups.push(g)});clip.cards.forEach(c=>{const old=c.id;c.id=uid("card");c.x=grid25(c.x+25);c.y=grid25(c.y+25);c.w=Math.max(150,grid25(c.w||cardWidth(c)));c.h=Math.max(75,grid25(c.h||cardHeight(c)));c.groupId=groupMap.get(c.groupId)||"";idMap.set(old,c.id);flow().cards.push(c)});clip.edges.forEach(e=>{const from=idMap.get(e.from),to=idMap.get(e.to);if(from&&to)flow().edges.push({...e,id:uid("edge"),from,to})});app.multiSelected.clear();if(clip.type==="group")app.selected={type:"group",id:[...groupMap.values()][0]};else{[...idMap.values()].forEach(id=>app.multiSelected.add(id));app.selected={type:"card",id:[...idMap.values()][0]}}persist();render();toast(`${clip.cards.length}件のカードを貼り付けました`)}
function autoLayout(){const f=flow();if(!f.cards.length)return;history();const ids=new Set(f.cards.map(c=>c.id)),links=f.edges.filter(e=>(e.kind||"normal")==="normal"&&e.from!==e.to&&ids.has(e.from)&&ids.has(e.to)),out=new Map(f.cards.map(c=>[c.id,[]])),indeg=new Map(f.cards.map(c=>[c.id,0]));links.forEach(e=>{out.get(e.from).push(e.to);indeg.set(e.to,indeg.get(e.to)+1)});const level=new Map(),visit=start=>{const queue=[start];while(queue.length){const id=queue.shift(),nextLevel=level.get(id)+1;out.get(id).forEach(to=>{if(level.has(to))return;level.set(to,nextLevel);queue.push(to)})}};f.cards.filter(c=>indeg.get(c.id)===0).forEach(c=>{if(!level.has(c.id)){level.set(c.id,0);visit(c.id)}});let componentLevel=Math.max(0,...level.values());f.cards.forEach(c=>{if(!level.has(c.id)){level.set(c.id,++componentLevel);visit(c.id)}});const buckets=new Map();f.cards.forEach(c=>{const l=level.get(c.id);if(!buckets.has(l))buckets.set(l,[]);buckets.get(l).push(c)});const levels=[...buckets.keys()].sort((a,b)=>a-b),xByLevel=new Map();let x=0;levels.forEach(l=>{xByLevel.set(l,x);x+=Math.max(...buckets.get(l).map(cardWidth))+75});levels.forEach(l=>{const cards=buckets.get(l);let total=cards.reduce((sum,c)=>sum+cardHeight(c),0)+(cards.length-1)*50,y=-total/2;cards.forEach(c=>{c.x=grid25(xByLevel.get(l));c.y=grid25(y);y+=cardHeight(c)+50})});f.groups.forEach(fitGroup);persist();app.view={x:100,y:innerHeight/2,zoom:1};render();fitView();toast(`全体を整列しました（${f.cards.length}件）`)}
function fitView(){const items=flow().cards,t=flow().timeline;let minX,maxX,minY,maxY;if(t.enabled){const m=timelineMetrics();minX=t.x-50;minY=t.y-50;maxX=t.x+m.width+50;maxY=t.y+m.height+50}else if(items.length){minX=Math.min(...items.map(c=>c.x))-80;minY=Math.min(...items.map(c=>c.y))-80;maxX=Math.max(...items.map(c=>c.x+cardWidth(c)))+80;maxY=Math.max(...items.map(c=>c.y+cardHeight(c)))+80}else{app.view={x:90,y:110,zoom:1};return updateTransform()}const vp=$("#viewport").getBoundingClientRect(),availW=vp.width-300,availH=vp.height-100,z=Math.min(1.25,Math.max(.3,Math.min(availW/(maxX-minX),availH/(maxY-minY))));app.view.zoom=z;app.view.x=20-minX*z;app.view.y=(vp.height-(maxY-minY)*z)/2-minY*z;updateTransform()}
function jumpToCard(id){const c=card(id),vp=$("#viewport").getBoundingClientRect();app.view.x=(vp.width-300)/2-(c.x+cardWidth(c)/2)*app.view.zoom;app.view.y=vp.height/2-(c.y+cardHeight(c)/2)*app.view.zoom;app.selected={type:"card",id};updateTransform();render()}
function exportBounds(){const f=flow(),boxes=[];if(f.timeline.enabled){const m=timelineMetrics();boxes.push({x:f.timeline.x,y:f.timeline.y,w:m.width,h:m.height})}f.groups.forEach(g=>boxes.push({x:g.x,y:g.y,w:g.w,h:g.h}));f.cards.forEach(c=>boxes.push({x:c.x,y:c.y,w:cardWidth(c),h:cardHeight(c)}));if(!boxes.length)return{x:-80,y:-80,w:800,h:500};const pad=220,minX=Math.min(...boxes.map(b=>b.x))-pad,minY=Math.min(...boxes.map(b=>b.y))-pad,maxX=Math.max(...boxes.map(b=>b.x+b.w))+pad,maxY=Math.max(...boxes.map(b=>b.y+b.h))+pad;return{x:Math.floor(minX),y:Math.floor(minY),w:Math.ceil(maxX-minX),h:Math.ceil(maxY-minY)}}
function exportCss(){let css="";for(const sheet of document.styleSheets){try{css+=[...sheet.cssRules].map(r=>r.cssText).join("\n")}catch{}}return css}
